# Scratch queue rows UPG (plan_process_overhaul.md P2.1). Data: the queue table in scratch_queue.md is generated
# from this file (python3 tools/status_index.py). Format: tools/scratch_query/qrows.py docstring.
# Run: the driver (qrun.py drive): every section is a multi-boot step on the mod set release_1202 (boot 1) and the
# full pack (boot 2 and later), one world.

@@section 1
@@title SQ-UPG 1.2.02 upgrade: a world built on the 1.2.02 release, booted on the current jars, 2026-11-18 ([plan_rowfix_r1118.md](../plan_rowfix_r1118.md) section 4, owner ruling 1; TODO `generators-and-tests #23`)
@@date 2026-11-18
@@reviewed 2026-11-20
@@jars creativecommon creativecompat creativedelight creativeequipment creativemagic creativelabels creativeworldgen
@@sources feature_writeup/plan_rowfix_r1118.md feature_writeup/namespace_move.md
@@tier T3
@@modset release_1202
@@prep copy tools/scratch_query/nsm_fixture.js kubejs/server_scripts/zz_nsm_fixture.js
@@prep toml creative_labels-common.toml notes noteLength 20
@@prep toml creative_labels-client.toml labels textDistance 10.0
@@prep toml exposure_extras-common.toml camera_bag leatherSlots 6
@@prep toml baby_mobs-common.toml spawns squidBabyChance 0.75
@@prep toml more_mooblooms-common.toml moobloom regrowChance 0.6
@@prep boot=2: modset pack
@@prep boot=2: copy tools/scratch_query/nsm_probe.js kubejs/server_scripts/zz_nsm_probe.js
@@text
@@text Boot 1 runs the deployed 1.2.02 pack (`deploy/latest/mods`, kubejs and config of commit 40ed32be; owner ruling 3) plus the
@@text dev perfBot jar (kept by the manifest's `dev_keep`; bots for worn gear and players in other dimensions; no Creative Devtools: boot-1 rows use vanilla commands
@@text and the KubeJS fixture probe `/nsmfix`). Boot 2 switches to the full current pack, world kept, and runs the old SQ-NSM,
@@text SQ-HOP, SQ-RFX, SQ-BM, SQ-RDB and SQ-VH fixture checks. Old config edits (the r1111 NSM fixture's and SQ-RFX-25's) are
@@text `@@prep toml` lines before boot 1. Layout: NSM fixture x 0..16 z 0..30 (nsm_fixture.js), mooblooms and squid x 40,
@@text painting x 60, hops x 620, Rustic blocks x 200..220 z 200.
@@text
@@table
## SQ-UPG-01 | boot 1 (1.2.02 jars): build the old-id world (NSM fixture, painting, hops, tilled end stone, mooblooms, baby squid, Rustic blocks)
@group A
@commands `/nsmfix chests placed ground bags bots gear labels label potjar dims logout manifest`; summon an old-motive Immersive Painting; place H&H hops lattices and tilled end stone; summon the three mooblooms, a baby squid and an egg chest under the `more_mooblooms:` ids; place the Rustic blocks with their states; `randomTickSpeed 0`; `save-all flush`
@pass every `[nsmfix]` step ends `OK step <name> finished` (the r1111 MISSING lines for backpack skins and the iron camera bag are expected); no `Unknown (block|entity)` or `Incorrect argument` reply; the save completes
@fails a fixture step failing: `tools/scratch_query/nsm_fixture.js` against the 1.2.02 jars; an unknown id: the 1.2.02 jar set (modsets/release_1202.toml)
@absent creativeengineering:paintings/minecraft/alban.png hearthandharvest:hops hearthandharvest:tilled_end_stone more_mooblooms:moobloom more_mooblooms:moobloom_spawn_egg more_mooblooms:peonybloom (1.2.02 ids, placed on the release jars on purpose)
# replaces the r1111 fixture build (nsm_fixture.sh), jar_archive/p4_oldid (SQ-RFX-25 boot 1) and jar_archive/displaced (SQ-HOP-11)
