## SQ-UPG-02 | old Equipment, Magic and lunchbox ids: chests, worn, Curios and dropped items read back under the new ids
@group A
@boot 2
@commands Boot; open the chest; check the worn shield and Curios stepstool; walk to the dropped items and Dark Fire; `/save-all flush`; `/data get block <chest>`
@pass Log: `[swaps]` remap lines for every `creativeengineering:` Equipment and Magic id and `solapplepie:netherite_lunchbox`, nothing unresolved. Chest, offhand, Curios slot and ground items read back under `creativeequipment:` / `creativemagic:` / `creativedelight:netherite_lunchbox` with NBT kept (shield patterns, lunchbox contents); Dark Fire still burns; stepstool still lifts
@fails Item gone: swap list missing from the jar (`data/<ns>/swaps/owner_namespace.json`). Missing model: assets not moved into `assets/<ns>/`
@from rows/NSM.qb SQ-NSM-02 (r1118 R3: was its fixture copy)
bootreject \[swaps\] .*unresolved
> forceload add 0 0 16 28
> pbot spawn nsmA 2 -60 28 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
shell grep -E "\[swaps\]" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-240 | head -20
> cdevtest inv 0 -60 0
> cdevtest inv 2 -60 0
> cdevtest inv 4 -60 0
> cdevtest entities 8 -60 8 10 type=minecraft:item nbt
> cdevtest state 0 -60 4
> cdevtest player nsmA
> data get entity nsmA ForgeCaps
bootexpect \[swaps\] minecraft:item: \d+ id\(s\) remapped
expect verb=inv slot=\d+ item="?creativeequipment:\S*shield
expect verb=inv slot=\d+ item="?creativeequipment:diamond_shield\*1\{.*Patterns
expect verb=inv slot=2 item="?creativedelight:netherite_lunchbox
expect verb=entities type=minecraft:item .*creativedelight:netherite_lunchbox
expect verb=state pos=0,-60,4 state="?\S+:dark_fire
expect verb=player name=nsmA .*off="?creativeequipment:\S*shield
reject item="?creativeengineering:|id:\\"creativeengineering:|id:\\"solapplepie:netherite_lunchbox|state="?creativeengineering:
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ done=0
look swaps lines: every creativeengineering Equipment and Magic id and solapplepie:netherite_lunchbox remapped, 0 unresolved; the lunchbox keeps its food (NBT in the inv line); Curios feet slot in the ForgeCaps line holds a creativeequipment stepstool (a crow may carry the red one, scratch_run_2026-11-11); Dark Fire and stepstool behaviour unchanged

