@group A
@boot 2
@commands boot 2 log and config: `grep "\[swaps\]" logs/latest.log`; `config/moremooblooms-common.toml`, `config/babymobs-common.toml` (boot 1 set `regrowChance = 0.6` and `squidBabyChance = 0.75` in the old files)
@pass boot 2 log: `[swaps] ... namespace move(s)` counts the list, `[swaps] minecraft:entity_type: 1 id(s) remapped` and the same for `minecraft:item`; `[swaps] config more_mooblooms-common.toml carried over to moremooblooms-common.toml` and the `baby_mobs` one; no `Identifier .* is missing` / missing registry entry naming `more_mooblooms` or `baby_mobs`; `config/` holds `moremooblooms-common.toml` (`regrowChance = 0.6`) and `babymobs-common.toml` (`squidBabyChance = 0.75`), the old files gone
@fails ids missing: the swap list is not in the moreMooblooms member jar (`data/moremooblooms/swaps/`) or the world was opened once without it; a config at defaults: `CreativeWorldgen` did not call `carryOver` before Forge read the COMMON configs
